# Fonts motanka-fonts ships, read by debian/fonts-build.sh. One line per
# font file of the orig-jetbrains-mono-nerd component, fields separated by
# tabs:
#   <file name in the archive>  <family it must have>  <fontconfig weight>  <fontconfig slant>
# Weight 80 is Regular and 200 Bold; slant 0 is upright and 100 italic. The
# family is one of the names fc-scan reports for the file; the weight and
# slant are fc-scan's values. Each file is installed unchanged as
# /opt/motanka/share/fonts/jetbrains-mono-nerd/<file name>.
#
# "JetBrainsMono Nerd Font" is the family Upstream's
# default/fontconfig/conf.avail/50-omarchy.conf maps "monospace" to (the
# family of the bar and menus) and the one config/alacritty, config/ghostty
# and config/foot name, with the styles Regular, Bold and Italic.
# "JetBrainsMono Nerd Font Mono" is its single-width variant, for programs
# that ask for strictly monospaced glyphs.
JetBrainsMonoNerdFont-Regular.ttf	JetBrainsMono Nerd Font	80	0
JetBrainsMonoNerdFont-Bold.ttf	JetBrainsMono Nerd Font	200	0
JetBrainsMonoNerdFont-Italic.ttf	JetBrainsMono Nerd Font	80	100
JetBrainsMonoNerdFont-BoldItalic.ttf	JetBrainsMono Nerd Font	200	100
JetBrainsMonoNerdFontMono-Regular.ttf	JetBrainsMono Nerd Font Mono	80	0
JetBrainsMonoNerdFontMono-Bold.ttf	JetBrainsMono Nerd Font Mono	200	0
JetBrainsMonoNerdFontMono-Italic.ttf	JetBrainsMono Nerd Font Mono	80	100
JetBrainsMonoNerdFontMono-BoldItalic.ttf	JetBrainsMono Nerd Font Mono	200	100
